1
00:00:56,309 --> 00:01:02,698
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,422
Don't worry.

3
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,357
I always take care of my own.

4
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,427
You'll definitely get rewarded.

5
00:01:16,255 --> 00:01:18,269
Your Highness, do you really see me as

6
00:01:18,637 --> 00:01:20,877
a companion you can just keep around for your amusement?

7
00:01:21,736 --> 00:01:24,669
You were the one who offered yourself for a recommendation.

8
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:27,038
Now you're suddenly acting all righteous.

9
00:01:27,216 --> 00:01:30,245
Since you're no gentleman, why bother acting all high and mighty?

10
00:01:43,776 --> 00:01:44,896
You're right, Your Highness.

11
00:01:44,983 --> 00:01:46,231
Starting tomorrow night,

12
00:01:46,322 --> 00:01:48,982
I'll come and serve you in your chamber.

13
00:02:02,047 --> 00:02:05,110
From now on, you can enter and leave the Princess Residence with this.

14
00:02:15,515 --> 00:02:17,210
We've only been given three months.

15
00:02:17,408 --> 00:02:19,408
There's no way we can complete the Yongtong Canal.

16
00:02:19,464 --> 00:02:21,580
Is there a way to stall the construction

17
00:02:21,695 --> 00:02:23,032
and shift the blame onto someone else?

18
00:02:23,056 --> 00:02:24,687
The deadline is set by His Majesty.

19
00:02:25,246 --> 00:02:27,431
And by imperial order, you need to supervise the project.

20
00:02:27,455 --> 00:02:28,973
If we openly drag our feet,

21
00:02:29,112 --> 00:02:31,565
we'll give the Second Prince something to hold against us.

22
00:02:34,911 --> 00:02:36,884
So, what ideas do you all have?

23
00:02:42,766 --> 00:02:46,346
In my opinion, we should ask Princess Zhao Yang about this.

24
00:02:46,607 --> 00:02:48,123
If she hadn't messed up,

25
00:02:48,255 --> 00:02:50,536
Shen Xiao wouldn't have had an audience with His Majesty.

26
00:02:50,648 --> 00:02:52,076
As for the Yongtong Canal,

27
00:02:52,295 --> 00:02:55,560
she should be the one to devise a plan for you to make up for her mistakes.

28
00:02:55,903 --> 00:02:58,693
Yes. Chancellor Xiao has a point.

29
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,533
That's right.

30
00:03:06,336 --> 00:03:09,633
Tell Zhao Yang that I'll give her one last chance.

31
00:03:10,023 --> 00:03:12,357
The Eastern Palace doesn't keep anyone who's useless.

32
00:03:12,695 --> 00:03:15,087
If Zhao Yang has a plan, she'll definitely report it.

33
00:03:15,416 --> 00:03:16,909
But at the end of the day,

34
00:03:17,712 --> 00:03:19,312
it's all Shen Xiao's fault.

35
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:20,518
That's right.

36
00:03:20,871 --> 00:03:23,204
Shen Xiao will be under your supervision at the Censorate.

37
00:03:24,776 --> 00:03:26,518
Don't go easy on him.

38
00:03:26,936 --> 00:03:30,158
Don't worry, Your Highness. I understand.

39
00:03:32,975 --> 00:03:34,830
Why wait until he gets to the Censorate?

40
00:03:36,711 --> 00:03:39,599
We can teach him a lesson today.

41
00:03:50,295 --> 00:03:51,906
How did I end up agreeing to this?

42
00:04:13,735 --> 00:04:15,230
(The Crown Prince's men)

43
00:04:16,239 --> 00:04:18,213
(really can't keep their noses out of things.)

44
00:05:12,975 --> 00:05:14,829
You went to see Shen Xiao.

45
00:05:16,656 --> 00:05:19,240
Do I need to report my whereabouts to you now?

46
00:05:26,783 --> 00:05:28,877
I'm just asking for the Crown Prince.

47
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:32,613
You really are the Crown Prince's loyal lapdog.

48
00:05:33,446 --> 00:05:36,400
After the Luming Banquet, the Crown Prince has started suspecting you.

49
00:05:36,535 --> 00:05:38,053
I've been covering for you,

50
00:05:38,193 --> 00:05:40,098
but I need you to be straight with me.

51
00:05:44,666 --> 00:05:48,099
That Top Scholar is pretty easy on the eyes. I like what I see.

52
00:05:48,535 --> 00:05:50,350
I'm thinking of making him my companion.

53
00:05:51,495 --> 00:05:55,256
I wonder if that answer satisfies you, Prince Consort.

54
00:05:57,009 --> 00:05:59,064
Don't you care about your identity as a Cui family wife?

55
00:05:59,088 --> 00:06:00,302
Let go!

56
00:06:02,415 --> 00:06:04,158
- Let go! - You're lying!

57
00:06:07,799 --> 00:06:09,013
Let me go.

58
00:06:18,863 --> 00:06:20,197
What's your problem?

59
00:06:22,696 --> 00:06:23,910
Li Shu.

60
00:06:24,367 --> 00:06:26,389
I'm still your Prince Consort, aren't I?

61
00:06:28,192 --> 00:06:29,204
Prince Consort?

62
00:06:29,295 --> 00:06:31,847
We've been faking this marriage for years. Do you think it's real now?

63
00:06:31,871 --> 00:06:32,989
Yes.

64
00:06:33,136 --> 00:06:34,430
The marriage between us is fake.

65
00:06:34,776 --> 00:06:36,069
But is the relationship

66
00:06:37,383 --> 00:06:38,758
between you and him real?

67
00:06:40,096 --> 00:06:41,550
That's none of your business.

68
00:06:44,504 --> 00:06:45,718
Fine.

69
00:06:47,656 --> 00:06:49,791
What a perfect scholar-lover you have.

70
00:06:51,344 --> 00:06:54,296
- If the Crown Prince found out... - Are you going to snitch on me?

71
00:06:54,415 --> 00:06:55,812
Have you forgotten

72
00:06:55,943 --> 00:06:59,161
that I just lost my fief after being publicly impeached by Shen Xiao?

73
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:01,836
And you actually believe I'd go after him as a companion?

74
00:07:01,927 --> 00:07:05,310
I met him to dig out more information for the Crown Prince.

75
00:07:05,481 --> 00:07:07,455
You seem awfully concerned about Shen Xiao.

76
00:07:08,183 --> 00:07:10,157
Are you jealous or something?

77
00:07:14,024 --> 00:07:15,142
Ridiculous.

78
00:07:16,258 --> 00:07:18,927
I'm just warning you to keep your distance from Shen Xiao.

79
00:07:19,096 --> 00:07:21,460
Don't do anything that would disgrace the Cui family.

80
00:07:21,975 --> 00:07:24,643
The Crown Prince is furious about the Yongtong Canal incident.

81
00:07:24,896 --> 00:07:26,550
If you can't come up with a solution,

82
00:07:26,727 --> 00:07:28,567
even the Cui family won't be able to save you.

83
00:07:29,592 --> 00:07:31,527
What nonsense are you spouting, Prince Consort?

84
00:07:32,455 --> 00:07:36,053
The Cui family and I are intertwined. We stand or fall together.

85
00:07:36,136 --> 00:07:37,374
Besides,

86
00:07:38,336 --> 00:07:40,186
how do you know I don't have a plan?

87
00:07:41,184 --> 00:07:42,398
That's good.

88
00:07:42,991 --> 00:07:44,471
Come with me to see the Crown Prince.

89
00:07:45,576 --> 00:07:46,790
No rush.

90
00:07:47,456 --> 00:07:48,990
Before we see the Crown Prince,

91
00:07:49,336 --> 00:07:50,949
you need to promise me one thing.

92
00:08:11,735 --> 00:08:12,949
Lord Cui.

93
00:08:26,191 --> 00:08:29,109
Greetings, Your Highness. I am your humble servant, Qing Luo.

94
00:08:29,376 --> 00:08:31,296
Wishing you peace and prosperity, Your Highness.

95
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,880
Did you drug the Princess?

96
00:08:51,184 --> 00:08:52,680
I didn't do it.

97
00:08:53,775 --> 00:08:56,928
Her Highness got set up because she kept visiting that kind of place.

98
00:08:57,055 --> 00:09:00,525
Someone must have deliberately framed me for what happened to Her Highness.

99
00:09:00,631 --> 00:09:01,875
Lord Cui, you have to believe me.

100
00:09:01,899 --> 00:09:03,615
Please stand up for me.

101
00:09:03,696 --> 00:09:04,910
Believe you?

102
00:09:05,104 --> 00:09:07,517
When did I ever say it was an aphrodisiac?

103
00:09:08,759 --> 00:09:10,036
You wicked woman.

104
00:09:10,159 --> 00:09:12,279
How could you do something like that to the Princess?

105
00:09:13,353 --> 00:09:14,510
Lord Cui.

106
00:09:14,591 --> 00:09:16,026
Let me explain.

107
00:09:17,071 --> 00:09:19,355
I was just guessing.

108
00:09:19,863 --> 00:09:21,580
At a place like the Xianke Bordello,

109
00:09:21,687 --> 00:09:24,989
what else would they have but those kinds of shady drugs?

110
00:09:26,096 --> 00:09:27,227
Enough.

111
00:09:27,710 --> 00:09:29,070
I don't want to hear another word.

112
00:09:29,176 --> 00:09:30,390
Twenty strokes of cane.

113
00:09:32,655 --> 00:09:33,869
You can't hit me!

114
00:09:34,855 --> 00:09:36,069
You can't hit me.

115
00:09:36,456 --> 00:09:38,709
I'm carrying the Cui family's child.

116
00:09:42,216 --> 00:09:43,470
What did you say?

117
00:09:45,095 --> 00:09:46,708
I'm pregnant.

118
00:09:50,056 --> 00:09:52,097
You're going to be a father, Lord Cui.

119
00:09:54,375 --> 00:09:56,630
Did you stop the birth control behind my back?

120
00:09:58,352 --> 00:09:59,566
I didn't.

121
00:10:00,255 --> 00:10:02,469
This is an accident.

122
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:06,390
Lord Cui, I'm carrying your child.

123
00:10:06,735 --> 00:10:08,351
- It's fate. - Shut up.

124
00:10:10,008 --> 00:10:11,383
Get rid of the baby.

125
00:10:12,687 --> 00:10:13,901
Kick her out of the residence.

126
00:10:15,015 --> 00:10:17,113
No!

127
00:10:17,536 --> 00:10:20,333
Cui Jin Zhi. The baby is the Cui family's bloodline.

128
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,840
You're not worthy to be the mother!

129
00:10:44,336 --> 00:10:46,469
What rights do you have to judge me?

130
00:10:47,375 --> 00:10:50,430
How are you any cleaner or nobler than me?

131
00:10:51,296 --> 00:10:54,154
You want to keep your spotless reputation as a nobleman,

132
00:10:54,295 --> 00:10:56,830
the affection of your beloved confidante,

133
00:10:57,135 --> 00:10:59,804
and the power that comes with the Princess Residence.

134
00:11:00,576 --> 00:11:01,790
Now,

135
00:11:02,135 --> 00:11:04,630
you want to throw me away just to save face!

136
00:11:05,135 --> 00:11:08,109
What kind of nobleman is that?

137
00:11:08,264 --> 00:11:10,865
You're just a scheming little man.

138
00:11:10,973 --> 00:11:13,853
You seduced me. Now, you are tossing me away and killing your own child!

139
00:11:16,655 --> 00:11:18,589
You've really let me down.

140
00:11:20,855 --> 00:11:22,349
I've done what I promised you.

141
00:11:22,696 --> 00:11:24,430
Don't forget what you promised me.

142
00:11:25,336 --> 00:11:26,550
Do it.

143
00:11:29,735 --> 00:11:30,853
Don't touch me!

144
00:11:30,936 --> 00:11:32,979
Don't hurt my child.

145
00:11:33,336 --> 00:11:34,550
Don't touch me.

146
00:11:35,328 --> 00:11:37,910
Don't hurt my child.

147
00:11:38,696 --> 00:11:40,069
Let me go!

148
00:11:41,176 --> 00:11:42,709
Don't hurt my mother!

149
00:11:46,452 --> 00:11:48,170
You little brat! Are you crazy?

150
00:11:48,337 --> 00:11:49,711
Let me out to get the imperial physician!

151
00:11:49,735 --> 00:11:51,253
Or you can beat me to death!

152
00:11:51,336 --> 00:11:53,989
Can you bear the consequences of harming a royal heir?

153
00:11:55,735 --> 00:11:58,910
Is a girl born to a lowly maid worthy of being called a royal heir?

154
00:11:59,424 --> 00:12:01,221
Your mother is of lowly birth.

155
00:12:01,336 --> 00:12:03,656
She's not worthy to get checked by the imperial physician.

156
00:12:04,855 --> 00:12:06,069
Mother!

157
00:12:08,696 --> 00:12:10,052
Please, Lady Shang Yi.

158
00:12:10,135 --> 00:12:12,320
Please get the imperial physician to save her.

159
00:12:12,495 --> 00:12:13,613
It's pointless to beg me.

160
00:12:13,696 --> 00:12:15,235
She's a dancer born of low status.

161
00:12:15,451 --> 00:12:17,400
Does she think she can rise in status through her child?

162
00:12:17,424 --> 00:12:18,660
You two

163
00:12:18,751 --> 00:12:21,606
can fend for yourselves in the Cold Palace.

164
00:12:27,375 --> 00:12:28,589
Mother.

165
00:12:28,735 --> 00:12:30,583
There's century-old ginseng among the tributes.

166
00:12:30,607 --> 00:12:32,740
I'll go and get it to help you get better.

167
00:12:33,696 --> 00:12:35,886
I can't keep dragging you down, my child.

168
00:12:36,001 --> 00:12:38,266
Shu. Remember this.

169
00:12:38,837 --> 00:12:41,957
No one in this world is born lowly.

170
00:12:42,495 --> 00:12:45,053
And no one is born noble either.

171
00:12:45,433 --> 00:12:48,910
Your fate is something you have to fight for yourself.

172
00:12:49,087 --> 00:12:50,781
Do you understand?

173
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:53,084
Let go of me!

174
00:12:53,536 --> 00:12:55,539
Don't hurt my child!

175
00:12:55,696 --> 00:12:56,853
Stop!

176
00:12:56,967 --> 00:12:58,340
Leave her to me.

177
00:12:59,775 --> 00:13:01,492
- Leave us. - Yes, Your Highness.

178
00:13:08,168 --> 00:13:09,901
I don't care what's going on between

179
00:13:10,408 --> 00:13:11,901
you and Cui Jin Zhi.

180
00:13:12,088 --> 00:13:13,981
But you shouldn't have tried to set me up.

181
00:13:14,375 --> 00:13:15,829
You should know

182
00:13:16,632 --> 00:13:18,846
that having this child won't tie Cui Jin Zhi to you.

183
00:13:19,975 --> 00:13:22,655
There's no such thing as a mother gaining status through her child.

184
00:13:22,871 --> 00:13:24,360
The child is only noble

185
00:13:24,696 --> 00:13:25,989
when the mother is noble.

186
00:13:26,696 --> 00:13:28,709
Are you satisfied now, Your Highness?

187
00:13:31,696 --> 00:13:33,566
Do you want your child to live?

188
00:13:40,552 --> 00:13:42,983
(Taiji Hall)

189
00:13:43,064 --> 00:13:44,278
Crown Prince.

190
00:13:44,576 --> 00:13:46,600
About the restoration of the Yongtong Canal,

191
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:47,964
how's the progress?

192
00:13:50,807 --> 00:13:52,021
Father.

193
00:13:53,536 --> 00:13:56,070
The Yongtong Canal is a massive project with many laborers.

194
00:13:56,287 --> 00:13:57,895
But lately, grain prices have shot up.

195
00:13:58,280 --> 00:14:01,000
The wages from the court aren't enough for them to buy food anymore.

196
00:14:01,096 --> 00:14:02,829
Thus, a lot of workers have gone on strike.

197
00:14:03,431 --> 00:14:04,880
I have a plan.

198
00:14:05,279 --> 00:14:06,475
It might solve the problem.

199
00:14:06,646 --> 00:14:07,860
What's your plan?

200
00:14:08,176 --> 00:14:10,366
Pay them with grain instead of money.

201
00:14:10,457 --> 00:14:12,774
Pay them with grain instead of money.

202
00:14:12,904 --> 00:14:14,631
Since grain is expensive and money is cheap...

203
00:14:14,655 --> 00:14:17,235
Since grain is expensive and money is cheap, why not

204
00:14:17,576 --> 00:14:21,020
have the Ministry of Revenue distribute grain directly as payment?

205
00:14:21,464 --> 00:14:22,678
This way,

206
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:26,229
the workers will feel at ease when they have food.

207
00:14:26,375 --> 00:14:28,160
It'll also stabilize the wages.

208
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:31,270
It'll win people's support and boost their morale.

209
00:14:36,144 --> 00:14:39,171
This way, the responsibility for repairing Yongtong Canal

210
00:14:39,296 --> 00:14:42,136
can all be pushed onto the Ministry of Revenue under the Second Prince.

211
00:14:42,495 --> 00:14:44,270
If the canal isn't finished in the end,

212
00:14:44,750 --> 00:14:47,550
the Ministry of Revenue will be blamed for not supplying enough grain.

213
00:14:47,584 --> 00:14:48,878
Not only that,

214
00:14:49,367 --> 00:14:52,320
I can use this chance to ask the Ministry of Revenue for more grain

215
00:14:52,536 --> 00:14:54,510
to fill my private account.

216
00:14:58,536 --> 00:15:01,177
But the Second Prince will definitely object to this.

217
00:15:01,305 --> 00:15:02,639
He can't object.

218
00:15:03,623 --> 00:15:04,837
The Crown Prince

219
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,174
can just repeat what Shen Xiao Zhi said that day.

220
00:15:07,495 --> 00:15:10,052
Father, there's never been a precedent for paying with grain.

221
00:15:10,174 --> 00:15:12,320
- I'm afraid this plan... - Second Brother.

222
00:15:12,814 --> 00:15:15,595
If there's no precedent, then let's be the first.

223
00:15:15,768 --> 00:15:17,617
Are we going to let the people fend for themselves

224
00:15:17,641 --> 00:15:19,798
just because it's difficult?

225
00:15:19,936 --> 00:15:21,536
As princes, when it comes to everything,

226
00:15:22,135 --> 00:15:23,349
you and I

227
00:15:24,831 --> 00:15:28,165
must always put the people and the country first.

228
00:15:28,775 --> 00:15:30,769
If we don't pay with grain,

229
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:32,540
we'll have to raise wages for the workers.

230
00:15:32,628 --> 00:15:34,442
But the treasury is empty now.

231
00:15:34,567 --> 00:15:36,381
Father would never agree to that.

232
00:15:36,655 --> 00:15:39,282
The Crown Prince's plan is remarkable.

233
00:15:39,895 --> 00:15:43,227
Li Yan. Distribute grains to the Ministry of Works and the Ministry of War.

234
00:15:43,334 --> 00:15:45,709
Yes, Father.

235
00:15:49,966 --> 00:15:51,552
This plan is tightly connected at every step.

236
00:15:51,576 --> 00:15:53,453
Not only does it solve my urgent problem,

237
00:15:53,536 --> 00:15:56,109
but it also puts pressure on the Second Prince's weak spot.

238
00:15:57,135 --> 00:15:58,349
Brilliant.

239
00:15:59,096 --> 00:16:00,310
Truly brilliant.

240
00:16:04,368 --> 00:16:05,662
I'll take my leave now.

241
00:16:08,663 --> 00:16:10,743
(With the Ministry of Revenue distributing grains, )

242
00:16:10,895 --> 00:16:12,600
(the Second Prince is drawn in.)

243
00:16:12,833 --> 00:16:14,647
(When two parties fight, )

244
00:16:14,841 --> 00:16:17,014
(the third party will benefit from it.)

245
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:22,840
(Sold Out)

246
00:16:23,213 --> 00:16:25,175
(Sold Out)

247
00:16:25,256 --> 00:16:29,160
(Sold Out)

248
00:16:31,015 --> 00:16:33,829
- Move aside! - Sir, please spare us some food.

249
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,052
- Move aside! - Please give us something to eat.

250
00:16:38,135 --> 00:16:39,772
What are you doing? Move aside!

251
00:16:39,855 --> 00:16:42,616
- Please give us some food. - Are you lowlifes looking for trouble?

252
00:16:42,935 --> 00:16:44,612
Sir, please have some mercy.

253
00:16:44,695 --> 00:16:47,695
- Please give us something to eat. - Get lost! Lowly peasants.

254
00:17:06,256 --> 00:17:07,893
I wonder which high-ranking official

255
00:17:07,976 --> 00:17:09,572
is still parading through the streets

256
00:17:09,655 --> 00:17:12,524
in this time of crisis with starving people everywhere,

257
00:17:12,629 --> 00:17:13,965
letting his servants hurt people,

258
00:17:14,056 --> 00:17:15,909
with no regard for the laws of Ye.

259
00:17:23,815 --> 00:17:27,052
I was wondering who would dare block my carriage in public?

260
00:17:27,135 --> 00:17:29,069
So it's you, Censor Shen.

261
00:17:30,576 --> 00:17:31,790
It's the Princess.

262
00:17:36,135 --> 00:17:37,349
Your Highness.

263
00:17:40,272 --> 00:17:42,966
I'll punish my own coachman.

264
00:17:43,135 --> 00:17:44,897
But blocking a princess's carriage in public

265
00:17:44,988 --> 00:17:47,218
is considered an assassination. By law, that's a capital offense.

266
00:17:47,242 --> 00:17:49,524
A few lashes is already merciful.

267
00:17:49,615 --> 00:17:52,891
If you don't move, don't blame me for being harsh.

268
00:18:00,477 --> 00:18:02,033
Censor Shen, are you standing here

269
00:18:02,197 --> 00:18:03,891
because you are looking for a beating?

270
00:18:13,336 --> 00:18:15,111
Your Highness, you've always lived in luxury.

271
00:18:15,135 --> 00:18:17,961
You don't know what it's like to go without clothes, or to starve,

272
00:18:18,135 --> 00:18:19,990
or suffer like the common people.

273
00:18:20,576 --> 00:18:23,669
You talk about beating and killing the refugees of Ye on the street.

274
00:18:25,215 --> 00:18:27,017
Do you deserve to be a royal daughter

275
00:18:27,108 --> 00:18:28,843
and get the people's support?

276
00:18:42,647 --> 00:18:46,413
The clothes are still so dirty. Looks like you don't want to eat.

277
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,037
- Give it to me. - Let go!

278
00:18:49,175 --> 00:18:51,612
I haven't eaten in two days.

279
00:18:51,695 --> 00:18:53,092
Please, have mercy on me.

280
00:18:53,175 --> 00:18:56,069
When your mother died, the Emperor didn't even ask about her.

281
00:18:56,192 --> 00:18:58,520
Even if you die in this Cold Palace,

282
00:18:58,601 --> 00:19:02,416
His Majesty won't even spare you a glance.

283
00:19:11,554 --> 00:19:13,249
Live in luxury?

284
00:19:14,776 --> 00:19:16,612
Do you know me that well, Censor Shen?

285
00:19:16,695 --> 00:19:18,800
While you're making a grand speech here,

286
00:19:18,944 --> 00:19:20,421
do you know I'm on my way

287
00:19:20,536 --> 00:19:23,317
to deliver medicine to the epidemic area?

288
00:19:23,591 --> 00:19:26,750
If you hadn't stopped my carriage to question me, it would already be done.

289
00:19:32,776 --> 00:19:34,744
Your Highness is personally providing disaster relief.

290
00:19:34,768 --> 00:19:36,662
My words were out of line.

291
00:19:38,296 --> 00:19:40,080
But no matter what Your Highness is doing,

292
00:19:40,833 --> 00:19:42,953
it's no excuse for letting your servants hurt people.

293
00:20:09,641 --> 00:20:12,215
You are just trying to show off

294
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,333
by stopping me in public to lecture me.

295
00:20:20,231 --> 00:20:22,035
Your Highness is different from other nobles.

296
00:20:22,161 --> 00:20:23,878
At least you still care about the people.

297
00:20:24,056 --> 00:20:26,270
I lost His Majesty's favor when you impeached me.

298
00:20:26,393 --> 00:20:29,500
Gathering medicine for disaster victims is just a show for His Majesty.

299
00:20:29,655 --> 00:20:31,807
The victims want medicine. I want fame.

300
00:20:31,898 --> 00:20:33,592
Everyone gets what they need.

301
00:20:34,336 --> 00:20:36,180
Isn't that just like you, Censor Shen?

302
00:20:36,599 --> 00:20:37,692
I am not...

303
00:20:37,783 --> 00:20:40,579
If you want to use me, I can play along.

304
00:20:43,576 --> 00:20:45,429
Don't forget our meeting tonight.

305
00:20:46,455 --> 00:20:47,909
Apologize to Censor Shen.

306
00:20:48,496 --> 00:20:50,694
You're fined half a year's salary to compensate the people.

307
00:20:50,718 --> 00:20:52,303
Take 10 lashes when we return home.

308
00:20:52,504 --> 00:20:54,359
Censor Shen, I apologize for any offense.

309
00:21:22,709 --> 00:21:25,096
Thank you, sir.

310
00:21:25,186 --> 00:21:28,128
Thank you, sir.

311
00:21:31,446 --> 00:21:32,631
(Zhao Yang.)

312
00:21:33,895 --> 00:21:36,030
(What kind of person are you?)
